1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,070
Abbu, silai to aati hai, par bas ghar ke kapde silti hoon.

2
00:00:04,370 --> 00:00:10,286
Salma beti, yahi hunar tera business hai! Boutique khol, ladies tailoring shuru kar!

3
00:00:10,586 --> 00:00:13,227
Par grahak mere paas kyun aayenge, Abbu?

4
00:00:13,527 --> 00:00:20,105
Kyunki tu time pe degi! Achhi machine, pico machine aur kapdon ka stock, 40 hazaar.

5
00:00:20,405 --> 00:00:26,730
Blouse aur suit ki fitting mein naam bana. Fitting pasand aayi, to grahak zindagi bhar ka.

6
00:00:27,280 --> 00:00:31,102
Didi, college function ke liye ye lehenga sil do, par ekdum designer!

7
00:00:31,402 --> 00:00:34,999
Designer silai, ₹1,200. Shukravaar tak ready!

8
00:00:35,299 --> 00:00:39,605
Roz 2-3 order, yaani mahine ke 40 hazaar tak.

9
00:00:39,905 --> 00:00:45,485
Phir do kaarigar rakh, aur shaadi ke season mein bridal blouse ke order le.

10
00:00:45,785 --> 00:00:48,444
Salma Boutique, sheher mein dhoom! Life set!
